<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαν-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woven,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσὸν . . , ἐσθῆτά θ᾽ ὑφαντήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.136
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.231
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαντά τε εἵματα καλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφανταὶ γράμμασιν τοιαίδ᾽ ὑφαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1146
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαντοῖς ἐν πέπλοις Ἐρινύων</span>
			<i>woven</i> by them, of Clytemnestra's net, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1580
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύων ὑ.
			ἀμφίβληστρον,</span> of the Centaur's robe, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1052
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυίων εἶδος ὑφαντόν,</span>
			of the human frame, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				148
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα ὑφαντά τε καὶ λεῖα</span>
			<i>brocaded</i> and plain stuffs, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.97
			</span></i>.</div>
